Eyes at (8,±7)? Head width at x8 roughly? big circle width y±sqrt(100-4)=9.8, eye r2 at y7.5 fits. On top z10, small cylinders h0.8, radius1.8. Maybe use black not possible. Add eye discs and maybe vertical pupil? Not necessary.

